    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the compact thought stage, while the dense carrier continues through the same shared tick parameters.",
      "claim": "A persistent dense carrier, read and updated by a compact thought process.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense carrier, so spatial detail has somewhere to live. Windows keep the carrier local while preserving the tokens that will be updated. The DQ-CTM thought stage repeats on itself with shared parameters at each tick. The decoder reads the updated dense field after the repeated thought process finishes.",
